  <name>Cascade</name>
  <summary>Music and video for your Jellyfin server</summary>
  <developer id="xyz.chaosinc">
    <name>cha0s_1nc</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Cascade plays the music and video on your own Jellyfin server.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Synced lyrics, word by word where the song has them</li>
      <li>Crossfade, normalization and an equalizer</li>
      <li>Downloads for listening offline</li>
      <li>Movies and TV with subtitles and audio track choice</li>
      <li>Media keys, the desktop's media controls and Discord status</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
